    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math> is a function satisfying the equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>∀</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the period of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is",
